                                                "example_id": "a59c72a7-956c-4bb5-b02e-2292f6da32ce",
                                                "sense_id": "693d3dcf-59c6-361e-adcd-964af55151a3",
                                                "text": "Great errors and absurdities many […]commit for want of a friend to tell them of them, to the great damage both of their fame and fortune."
